# Simulation: Mix two solutions 1:1, then heat from 20°C to 200°C in 10 discrete steps
# The mixed solution has 50 mmol/kg C and 50 mmol/kg Ca (1 kg water)
# 10 steps: 20, 40, 60, 80, 100, 120, 140, 160, 180, 200°C

SOLUTION 1
    temp      20
    pH        7.0
    C(4)      50 mmol/kgw
    Ca        50 mmol/kgw
    units     mmol/kgw

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite   0.0   0.0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20.0  40.0  60.0  80.0  100.0  120.0  140.0  160.0  180.0  200.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   mixing_heating6.sel
    -reset  false
    -temperature true
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite

END
